          "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>SO *:</strong> Windows® 7 64-bit / Windows® 8 64-bit / Windows® 8.1 64-bit / Windows® 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5-2500 @3.3 GHz / AMD FX-8320 @3.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 4 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa de vídeo:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 560 Ti / AMD Radeon™ HD 6870 (1GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 11<br></li><li><strong>Rede:</strong> Conexão de internet banda larga<br></li><li><strong>Armazenamento:</strong> 10 GB de espaço disponível<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> DirectX® compatible<br></li><li><strong>Outras observações:</strong> Laptop versions of graphics cards may work but are NOT officially supported. Windows-compatible keyboards, mouse, optional controller (Xbox 360 Controller for Windows recommended)</li></ul>",
          "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>SO *:</strong> Windows® 7 64-bit / Windows® 8 64-bit / Windows® 8.1 64-bit / Windows® 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5-4670K @3.4 GHz / AMD FX-8350 @4.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 8 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa de vídeo:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 780 / AMD Radeon™ R9 290 (2GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 11<br></li><li><strong>Rede:</strong> Conexão de internet banda larga<br></li><li><strong>Armazenamento:</strong> 10 GB de espaço disponível<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> DirectX® compatible<br></li><li><strong>Outras observações:</strong> Laptop versions of graphics cards may work but are NOT officially supported. Windows-compatible keyboards, mouse, optional controller (Xbox 360 Controller for Windows recommended)</li></ul>"
